    "id": "01-strait-transit",
    "title": "Strait Transit",
    "subtitle": "Strait of Hormuz \u00b7 0340 local",
    "briefing": "## TASKING\n\nEscort **MV ARGO SPIRIT** east through the inbound traffic lane to the open-water gate at the eastern end of the strait.\n\nTraffic at this hour is almost entirely civilian. Fishing dhows work the shoals north of the lane and do not answer radio. Commercial air out of Bandar Abbas climbs through the strait on a published departure.\n\nSmall-craft activity has been reported in the last seventy-two hours. Nothing confirmed.\n\n**ROE: WEAPONS TIGHT.** Engagement requires a confirmed hostile or explicit authorisation.\n\nHold escort station within 5 nm of ARGO SPIRIT. She makes 12 knots and she does not manoeuvre.",
    "difficulty": 2,
    "durationLimit": 3600,
    "initialRoe": "tight",
