    {
      "id": "inquiry_friendly",
      "rating": "INQUIRY",
      "condition": {
        "flag": "sys.friendlyKilled",
        "is": true
      },
      "title": "Blue on Blue",
      "debrief": "The track you engaged was one of ours.\n\nThere is no version of this debrief that is about the strait, or the tanker, or the two small craft that came out of the dark to find her. There is only the track, and the seventeen seconds in which the decision was made, and the recorder that kept all of it.\n\nThe ship will be relieved on station within the week. You will not be aboard for it."
    },
    {
      "id": "inquiry_neutral",
      "rating": "INQUIRY",
      "condition": {
        "flag": "sys.neutralKilled",
        "is": true
      },
      "title": "Board of Inquiry Convened",
      "debrief": "The contact you destroyed was exactly what it appeared to be for most of the night: a boat with people on it, going somewhere ordinary.\n\nThe data was complete. The recorder has the whole ladder \u2014 every rung you climbed and every one you skipped. It will show that the information required to identify that contact was available to this ship, and that the decision was made before it was used.\n\nThe convoy's disposition, the state of the tanker, the two craft that may or may not have been closing her \u2014 none of that is what the board will ask about.\n\nAegis worked. That is always the finding."
    },
