      "title": "Textbook Escort",
      "debrief": "ARGO SPIRIT made open water on schedule and nobody who did not earn it went into the sea.\n\nWhat the recorder shows is a ship that used its ladder: interrogated before it illuminated, illuminated before it released, and released only against contacts it had actually identified. That is the whole of the tactic and it is harder than it sounds at four in the morning with a TAO asking for the rail.\n\nThe small craft were what they were. You found that out before you shot, which is the only part of this that was ever in your control."
    },
    {
      "id": "held_station",
