      "title": "Charge Delivered",
      "debrief": "The tanker is through and the strait is behind her.\n\nThe escort was looser than it should have been \u2014 there are stretches on the recorder where VALLEY FORGE is well outside the station she was ordered to hold, and a small craft making thirty-eight knots covers that gap faster than a cruiser can close it back.\n\nIt worked. Next time it may not, and the difference will not be anything you did differently."
    },
