        }
      },
      "title": "Escort Failed",
      "debrief": "ARGO SPIRIT is burning in the strait with her crew in the water.\n\nThe craft that did it was on the scope for a long time before it mattered. It was small, it was slow to classify, and it did not look like anything until it was close enough that looking no longer helped.\n\nThe ladder exists for exactly this contact. Every rung on it costs time, and the only time available was spent somewhere else."
    },
