      "title": "Transit Complete",
      "debrief": "The tanker made open water. It was closer than it needed to be.\n\nNothing in the log is a violation and nothing in it is good work either. The contacts that mattered were resolved late or not at all, and the ones that did not matter absorbed attention that was needed elsewhere.\n\nThe strait does this. It is mostly boredom, and the part that is not boredom arrives all at once and does not wait."
